  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det franska produktionsbologet LDM Produktions g&#xF6;r en l&#xE5;ngfilm och &#xE5;tta kortfilmer om FN&apos;s millenniem&#xE5;len. Sida har f&#xE5;tt erbjudande att vara medfinansi&#xE4;r och i motprestation f&#xE5; r&#xE4;ttigheterna till all ice kommersiell visning i Sverige.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The french film production company LDM is producing a series of short films and a feature film on the theme Millennium Development Goals. By becoming a funding partner Sida will attin the non-commercial rights to film in Sweden.</narrative>
